1
00:00:00,295 --> 00:00:04,175
(Sheldon:)Leonard, you are my roommate,
my source of transportation...

2
00:00:04,341 --> 00:00:08,341
(Sheldon:)...and you help me fold my sheets
when they come out of the dryer.

3
00:00:08,512 --> 00:00:10,342
(Sheldon:)You are safe.

4
00:00:11,515 --> 00:00:13,845
- Can I whistle?
- Don't be silly.

5
00:00:14,601 --> 00:00:15,641
(Penny:)Howard...

6
00:00:15,811 --> 00:00:17,561
(Sheldon:)...you do not have a Ph.D.

7
00:00:18,021 --> 00:00:21,021
(Sheldon:)Your cologne is an assault on the senses.

8
00:00:21,191 --> 00:00:24,861
(Sheldon:)And you're not available for video games
during the Jewish High Holidays.

9
00:00:26,071 --> 00:00:28,531
- Guilty as charged. I'm out.
- No.

10
00:00:28,698 --> 00:00:30,238
(Sheldon:)You, too, are safe.

11
00:00:31,618 --> 00:00:34,498
(Howard:)Come on. What do I have to do?

12
00:00:34,704 --> 00:00:36,874
(Penny:)Okay, you know what?
I see where this is going.

13
00:00:37,040 --> 00:00:38,250
(Penny:)I'm not one of you guys.

14
00:00:38,416 --> 00:00:40,206
(Penny:)- I'm not a scientist, so...
Penny...

15
00:00:40,377 --> 00:00:43,377
(Sheldon:)...everything you're saying is true,
but please allow me to continue.

16
00:00:43,547 --> 00:00:45,717
(Sheldon:)Raj, you're out.

17
00:00:51,138 --> 00:00:53,058
It's a good question.

18
00:00:53,223 --> 00:00:55,603
(Sheldon:)While you do provide
a certain cultural diversity...

19
00:00:55,767 --> 00:01:00,227
...to a homogenous group, your responses
to the questionnaire were truly disturbing.

